WEBVTT

00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:15.200
That's a river of stars.

00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:17.200
A river of stars?

00:01:51.740 --> 00:01:52.750
I'm full!

00:01:54.090 --> 00:01:57.590
Don't give Fujiwara-san's family too much trouble.

00:01:57.590 --> 00:01:58.970
Okay.

00:01:58.970 --> 00:02:00.550
Pop, you should hurry up.

00:02:00.550 --> 00:02:01.510
Ehhhh?

00:02:01.510 --> 00:02:04.520
What do you mean "Ehhhh?" Aren't you also going to Hadzuki-chan's villa?

00:02:04.520 --> 00:02:06.930
I'm sorry, but I'm not like you girls.

00:02:06.930 --> 00:02:11.050
I already promised to go on dates with my boyfriends.

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:17.210
Wow, you're already in third grade, and yet you still don't have a boyfriend.

00:02:17.210 --> 00:02:20.580
Why don't you all find some awesome boyfriends while you're there?

00:02:27.310 --> 00:02:30.060
Love is a Windy Ride Over a Plateau.

00:02:33.240 --> 00:02:35.340
Ahhhhh, what fresh weather.

00:02:35.340 --> 00:02:38.800
Ahhhhh, I really feel alive!

00:02:38.800 --> 00:02:42.490
And Hadzuki-chan's villa is so beautiful.

00:02:42.490 --> 00:02:43.760
Hadzuki-chan!

00:02:43.760 --> 00:02:46.470
Welcome, Doremi-chan, Ai-chan!

00:02:46.470 --> 00:02:49.730
I bid the two of you WELCOME!!!

00:02:49.730 --> 00:02:51.690
Let me out of here right now!

00:02:52.690 --> 00:02:54.940
Did you bring another guest?

00:02:54.940 --> 00:02:59.500
Doremi, what are you doing? Let me out! Right now!

00:02:59.500 --> 00:03:01.390
Baaya, can you take care of the cooking?

00:03:01.390 --> 00:03:03.030
I think they must be starving.

00:03:03.030 --> 00:03:04.990
Yes, yes, I'll go right now.

00:03:08.610 --> 00:03:09.820
That was painful.

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:12.790
Jeez, Majo Rika.

00:03:14.020 --> 00:03:17.820
Just when we finally get a chance to relax and enjoy our summer vacation.

00:03:17.820 --> 00:03:19.760
Why'd ya hafta come with us, Majo Rika?

00:03:20.750 --> 00:03:22.720
The weather sure is nice, here on the plateau.

00:03:23.240 --> 00:03:26.820
Wait, Majo Rika, if you run around like that, you'll be seen.

00:03:27.530 --> 00:03:32.410
In this nice weather, it'd be nice if I could play some tennis.

00:03:33.060 --> 00:03:34.150
Yes, tennis!

00:03:34.150 --> 00:03:35.250
Good idea.

00:03:35.250 --> 00:03:37.620
There's a tennis court nearby.

00:03:37.620 --> 00:03:39.110
Then we'll go after we eat.

00:03:39.110 --> 00:03:40.680
Let's go, let's go!

00:03:41.910 --> 00:03:43.030
My hands are itching.

00:03:43.030 --> 00:03:45.720
No, Majo Rika is keeping house.

00:03:45.720 --> 00:03:46.840
What did you say!?

00:03:48.800 --> 00:03:51.240
We should let them have fun once in a while.

00:03:51.240 --> 00:03:52.720
Right, Majo Rika?

00:03:53.880 --> 00:03:56.700
How dare they not take me along?

00:03:56.700 --> 00:03:57.960
I'll remember this!

00:04:03.910 --> 00:04:05.390
Oh? Tamaki's here too.

00:04:07.350 --> 00:04:11.060
She is! And she has a full tennis getup too.

00:04:11.060 --> 00:04:14.830
Oh, what a coincidence, meeting you all here.

00:04:14.830 --> 00:04:15.980
What are you all doing here?

00:04:15.980 --> 00:04:19.480
Ain't it obvious? To play tennis, duh!

00:04:19.990 --> 00:04:21.940
Oh? Tennis?

00:04:23.540 --> 00:04:24.430
What?

00:04:24.430 --> 00:04:28.900
How can you play such a fashionable sport in those clothes?

00:04:29.450 --> 00:04:31.660
Well excuse us, fashion police.

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:33.550
It's fine as long as we can play tennis.

00:04:35.680 --> 00:04:38.170
Oh yeah, where are the three of you staying?

00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:39.840
A motel? A cabin?

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:42.920
<i>I </i> am staying at a villa.

00:04:42.920 --> 00:04:45.220
I don't recall asking you where you're staying.

00:04:45.220 --> 00:04:48.180
We're stayin' at Hadzuki-chan's villa.

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:49.590
V-Villa?

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:53.140
Fujiwara-san's family has a villa too?

00:04:53.140 --> 00:04:57.100
Y-Yes, but it's just a small cabin.

00:04:57.100 --> 00:04:59.130
Yes, I thought as such.

00:04:59.130 --> 00:05:01.110
Hadzuki-chan, you don't need to be so polite with her.

00:05:01.110 --> 00:05:04.070
Tamaki-san, is your villa near here?

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:06.130
Yes, you can see it from here.

00:05:06.130 --> 00:05:07.520
It's over there.

00:05:08.790 --> 00:05:10.070
How about you, Fujiwara-san?

00:05:10.070 --> 00:05:12.880
Hadzuki-chan's villa is... over there!

00:05:14.890 --> 00:05:16.000
Howzat? Fabulous, huh?

00:05:17.280 --> 00:05:19.080
No way...

00:05:19.080 --> 00:05:21.000
We'll decide this with a tennis match.

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:22.460
What did you say?

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:24.800
Have any of you played tennis before?

00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:26.000
Nope.

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:28.570
I have, but I'm not that good.

00:05:28.570 --> 00:05:29.800
Today's my first time.

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:31.170
I see.

00:05:31.170 --> 00:05:34.480
If you want me to give you some pointers, I'd be glad to.

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:36.530
That's fine.

00:05:36.530 --> 00:05:39.440
Y-You girls can play, I'm not very confident about this.

00:05:44.340 --> 00:05:46.610
They're playing!

00:05:51.800 --> 00:05:53.940
What's this? Yer pretty bad yerself.

00:05:53.940 --> 00:05:55.080
Let's change courts.

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:57.250
Ai-chan, nice!

00:05:57.250 --> 00:05:58.510
What's with that?

00:05:58.510 --> 00:06:01.240
All because you are more athletic... Guys won't like you!

00:06:01.240 --> 00:06:02.710
I don't really care.

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:05.820
W-What's wrong, Doremi-chan?

00:06:05.820 --> 00:06:07.170
So cool...

00:06:07.170 --> 00:06:09.290
Really? Thank you.

00:06:15.310 --> 00:06:18.290
Did she see some guy she likes again?

00:06:20.350 --> 00:06:22.820
Kashiwagi-kun!

00:06:23.770 --> 00:06:24.780
You know him, Hadzuki-chan!?

00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:26.740
Hey!

00:06:26.740 --> 00:06:28.720
This is Kashiwagi Yutaka-kun.

00:06:28.720 --> 00:06:30.200
He lives around here.

00:06:30.200 --> 00:06:32.070
Hadzuki-chan, you came.

00:06:32.070 --> 00:06:35.250
He's even cooler up close.

00:06:35.250 --> 00:06:39.060
She's Harukaze Doremi-chan and she's Senoo Aiko-chan.

00:06:39.060 --> 00:06:41.040
I'm Tamaki Reika.

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:42.500
N-Nice to meet you.

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:45.330
Eh? Kashiwagi-kun is blushing.

00:06:45.990 --> 00:06:48.470
Don't tell me this is... Maybe, just maybe...!

00:06:49.620 --> 00:06:51.660
The mood's lookin' up for them!

00:06:51.660 --> 00:06:52.430
Yep.

00:06:54.330 --> 00:06:56.550
Oh my, he's looking at me!

00:06:57.450 --> 00:06:59.390
Am I that attractive?

00:06:59.390 --> 00:07:01.850
I'll just have to attack now.

00:07:01.850 --> 00:07:06.320
Excuse meeee! Can you teach me how to play tennis?

00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:08.450
Eh, uhm, w-well...

00:07:08.450 --> 00:07:11.660
People say that you get better by having others teach you.

00:07:11.660 --> 00:07:12.780
T-That's right.

00:07:12.780 --> 00:07:13.990
Right, right?

00:07:13.990 --> 00:07:18.130
Can you teach me everything, starting from the basics?

00:07:18.130 --> 00:07:18.910
Sure, okay...

00:07:18.910 --> 00:07:21.360
I want to do some review.

00:07:21.360 --> 00:07:23.880
You don't need to be so shy, even though I am attractive.

00:07:25.280 --> 00:07:26.840
Tamaki Reika!

00:07:26.840 --> 00:07:28.910
Don't mind her, Doremi-chan.

00:07:28.910 --> 00:07:30.710
We'll play tennis ourselves.

00:07:30.710 --> 00:07:33.300
Yes, it's rare that we come here, so let's have some fun.

00:07:33.900 --> 00:07:34.800
Fine.

00:07:35.530 --> 00:07:37.970
Um, I'll start with how to hold the racket.

00:07:38.940 --> 00:07:40.320
Like this?

00:07:40.320 --> 00:07:41.340
Not like that.

00:07:42.660 --> 00:07:44.440
Reika doesn't understand.

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:46.360
Can you hold my hand and teach me?

00:07:46.360 --> 00:07:47.940
U-U-U-Um...

00:07:54.530 --> 00:07:55.830
Excuse me.

00:07:55.830 --> 00:07:56.490
Wait!

00:07:59.910 --> 00:08:02.420
Kashiwagi-kun is coming this way.

00:08:02.420 --> 00:08:03.900
What should I do? What should I-

00:08:03.900 --> 00:08:04.580
D-augh!

00:08:04.720 --> 00:08:06.660
What're ya doin', Doremi-chan?

00:08:06.660 --> 00:08:07.800
U-Um...

00:08:07.800 --> 00:08:09.760
Y...Yes!

00:08:10.970 --> 00:08:12.220
Um...

00:08:12.220 --> 00:08:13.680
W-What is it?

00:08:14.180 --> 00:08:15.140
Well, you see...

00:08:15.140 --> 00:08:16.520
Y-Yes.

00:08:16.520 --> 00:08:20.590
If ya got somethin' to say, just spit it out.

00:08:20.590 --> 00:08:21.730
You'll feel better that way.

00:08:22.680 --> 00:08:23.270
In that case...

00:08:23.670 --> 00:08:25.730
That's fine, you don't need to force yourself!

00:08:26.950 --> 00:08:29.910
It's okay even if you don't say it now.

00:08:29.910 --> 00:08:30.840
Is that so?

00:08:30.840 --> 00:08:32.000
Yes.

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:33.030
You're right.

00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:34.990
What is with those two?

00:08:34.990 --> 00:08:37.170
Would you like to play tennis with me?

00:08:37.170 --> 00:08:38.980
Me? Sure.

00:08:38.980 --> 00:08:39.460
Let's go.

00:08:39.990 --> 00:08:43.440
You dare toss me aside... What is the meaning of this!?

00:08:43.440 --> 00:08:44.960
I'll take him back, definitely!

00:08:44.960 --> 00:08:47.380
What did Kashiwagi-kun say?

00:08:47.380 --> 00:08:49.670
Stop asking me! Jeez!

00:09:02.640 --> 00:09:05.100
They seem to be making good progress.

00:09:09.930 --> 00:09:11.910
He's so cool!

00:09:11.910 --> 00:09:15.570
Kashiwagi-kun lives on a blueberry farm around here.

00:09:15.570 --> 00:09:17.020
Blueberry?

00:09:17.660 --> 00:09:20.030
Wow, it sounds so romantic!

00:09:20.610 --> 00:09:23.000
Thanks for such a good practice game.

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:26.700
If ya don't mind, I can play with ya anytime.

00:09:26.700 --> 00:09:28.920
I heard that you live nearby.

00:09:28.920 --> 00:09:30.960
Why don't you let me give you a ride home?

00:09:31.540 --> 00:09:33.230
She's got him now!

00:09:33.230 --> 00:09:35.230
Where is your blueberry farm?

00:09:35.230 --> 00:09:36.440
Blueberry?

00:09:36.440 --> 00:09:39.440
Kashiwagi-kun's house is a blueberry farm.

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:42.210
Would you like to come play at my house?

00:09:42.210 --> 00:09:45.790
I want to thank you for practicing with me.

00:09:45.790 --> 00:09:47.230
We'll go, we'll go!

00:09:48.130 --> 00:09:48.920
She's got him now!

00:09:48.920 --> 00:09:51.060
Reika, I'm here to pick you up.

00:09:51.060 --> 00:09:53.190
I... I'm not ready...

00:09:53.190 --> 00:09:57.280
Kashiwagi-kun's coming with us, there's no problem.

00:09:57.280 --> 00:09:58.160
Bye-bye.

00:09:58.160 --> 00:09:59.610
Bye-bye...

00:10:00.510 --> 00:10:01.620
She tricked me.

00:10:01.620 --> 00:10:04.160
What an intense fight.

00:10:09.130 --> 00:10:10.340
Let's go.

00:10:10.340 --> 00:10:11.560
Are you serious?

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:38.810
Are these all blueberries?

00:10:38.810 --> 00:10:39.250
Yes.

00:10:39.780 --> 00:10:41.430
There's so much!

00:10:42.090 --> 00:10:43.700
The ones over here are ripe.

00:10:45.790 --> 00:10:47.720
Can we eat them without washing them?

00:10:47.720 --> 00:10:50.540
It's fine because we don't use any pesticides.

00:10:51.110 --> 00:10:53.540
But won't there be dust or dirt?

00:10:54.090 --> 00:10:56.390
That's also a part of nature's taste.

00:10:56.390 --> 00:10:58.230
Come on, try some, everyone.

00:10:58.230 --> 00:11:01.210
So generous, he's definitely cool.

00:11:04.440 --> 00:11:05.600
Delicious!

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:09.810
And I feel that the sky is so much bigger here.

00:11:09.810 --> 00:11:13.560
Yes, the night sky here is so full of stars that it makes you feel like there's a meteor shower.

00:11:15.330 --> 00:11:16.570
Really?

00:11:16.570 --> 00:11:18.680
I want all of you to see it.

00:11:18.680 --> 00:11:19.540
Really?

00:11:19.540 --> 00:11:20.770
I'll come, I'll come!

00:11:25.080 --> 00:11:26.990
Oh yeah, I haven't seen Majo Rika and Lala.

00:11:26.990 --> 00:11:28.760
Where the heck did they go?

00:11:28.760 --> 00:11:30.840
They aren't in the house.

00:11:30.840 --> 00:11:32.340
Oh well, let them be.

00:11:32.340 --> 00:11:33.330
Right, Doremi-chan?

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:37.110
Kashiwagi-kun's so cool.

00:11:37.110 --> 00:11:39.760
I'm so happy I get to see the stars with him...

00:11:40.660 --> 00:11:42.260
She's completely hopeless.

00:11:43.870 --> 00:11:44.900
Not yet, not yet!

00:11:48.090 --> 00:11:48.850
Lala smash!

00:11:52.580 --> 00:11:54.770
C-Coach, I'm at my limit.

00:11:54.770 --> 00:11:57.380
What are you saying? We're only just starting.

00:11:57.380 --> 00:11:58.470
Here I go!

00:11:58.470 --> 00:11:59.690
Lala serve!

00:12:02.680 --> 00:12:04.410
I'm about to cry.

00:12:11.630 --> 00:12:14.460
Yer right, there are so many stars.

00:12:15.750 --> 00:12:17.370
That's a river of stars.

00:12:17.960 --> 00:12:22.190
It's so romantic, looking at the stars at a blueberry farm.

00:12:25.890 --> 00:12:28.180
Oh? That's so cute.

00:12:28.180 --> 00:12:29.640
Is it a present from someone?

00:12:31.340 --> 00:12:34.150
This is a lucky charm from a upperclassman at the tennis club.

00:12:34.150 --> 00:12:35.380
Lucky charm?

00:12:35.380 --> 00:12:36.810
Is it from a girl?

00:12:36.810 --> 00:12:39.290
No, it's from a guy, of course.

00:12:40.580 --> 00:12:43.840
I could never get the courage to confess to the one I like.

00:12:45.120 --> 00:12:47.740
That's why my upperclassman gave me this.

00:12:49.470 --> 00:12:53.940
He said that he succeeded in confessing to the girl he liked with this.

00:12:53.940 --> 00:12:56.160
So so, have you ever succeeded in confessing?

00:12:56.900 --> 00:12:59.640
No, I always blew it.

00:12:59.640 --> 00:13:00.800
What d'ya mean?

00:13:02.320 --> 00:13:04.210
Kashiwagi-kun, what is it?

00:13:04.780 --> 00:13:05.990
U-Um...

00:13:05.990 --> 00:13:06.570
Yes?

00:13:11.030 --> 00:13:12.060
What are you doing? That was mean!

00:13:12.060 --> 00:13:13.520
N-No, I...!

00:13:15.300 --> 00:13:16.520
Yeah that's pretty bad.

00:13:16.520 --> 00:13:18.400
That's not all.

00:13:20.980 --> 00:13:22.380
U-Um...

00:13:22.380 --> 00:13:24.270
What is it, Kashiwagi-kun?

00:13:24.270 --> 00:13:25.520
I've decided...

00:13:25.520 --> 00:13:26.470
Ahhh!

00:13:26.470 --> 00:13:27.990
Oh, wow!

00:13:29.030 --> 00:13:31.150
That sort of thing happened every time.

00:13:31.150 --> 00:13:32.250
Every time?

00:13:32.250 --> 00:13:34.460
That's gotta sting.

00:13:34.460 --> 00:13:37.920
But still, ya sound like ya fall in love easily.

00:13:37.920 --> 00:13:39.880
Eh? R-Really?

00:13:39.880 --> 00:13:44.830
And the fact that you aren't able to confess to them makes you a lot like Doremi-chan.

00:13:44.830 --> 00:13:46.060
R-Really?

00:13:46.060 --> 00:13:47.020
Doremi-chan too?

00:13:47.020 --> 00:13:48.410
Eh, uhm, yeah...

00:13:48.410 --> 00:13:50.800
I see. We're alike, aren't we? The two of us.

00:13:51.350 --> 00:13:52.510
Kashiwagi-kun...

00:13:56.480 --> 00:13:59.230
We'll let 'em chat fer a while.

00:14:00.690 --> 00:14:03.650
We shouldn't interrupt them.

00:14:12.150 --> 00:14:15.780
Baaya will be worried if we don't get back soon.

00:14:15.780 --> 00:14:16.480
Yer right.

00:14:16.480 --> 00:14:18.210
Huh? Already?

00:14:19.010 --> 00:14:19.890
Be careful.

00:14:21.700 --> 00:14:23.380
Thank you so much fer today, Kashiwagi-kun.

00:14:23.380 --> 00:14:25.380
Aiko-chan, um...

00:14:27.350 --> 00:14:28.470
Doremi-chan!

00:14:31.600 --> 00:14:33.060
Are you okay, Doremi-chan?

00:14:33.310 --> 00:14:35.520
I'm fine...

00:14:35.520 --> 00:14:36.850
Thank goodness.

00:14:36.850 --> 00:14:39.780
Ya really make me worry all the time, Doremi-chan.

00:14:45.630 --> 00:14:48.820
Wow, I'm such a stupid stupid idiot!

00:14:48.820 --> 00:14:50.560
Could it be a Bad Item?

00:14:50.560 --> 00:14:51.740
Maybe.

00:14:52.630 --> 00:14:53.700
Bad Item?

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:56.350
Kashiwagi-kun's lucky charm.

00:14:56.350 --> 00:14:58.590
Maybe it's a Bad Item.

00:14:58.590 --> 00:15:02.960
Something bad happens every time he tries to confess. How suspicious.

00:15:02.960 --> 00:15:03.980
I see.

00:15:03.980 --> 00:15:07.240
Because of the Bad Item, he hasn't been successful once.

00:15:07.240 --> 00:15:08.420
Doremi-chan.

00:15:08.420 --> 00:15:10.380
Let's use the Pureleine Computer.

00:15:11.280 --> 00:15:12.890
Hadzuki-chan, Ai-chan.

00:15:12.890 --> 00:15:13.890
What?

00:15:13.890 --> 00:15:18.920
I'm so thankful that you two are willing to help me out for the sake of my love.

00:15:18.920 --> 00:15:19.980
Oh goodness...

00:15:20.740 --> 00:15:21.740
Let's go, Lala.

00:15:21.740 --> 00:15:22.900
Majo Rika?

00:15:23.440 --> 00:15:24.900
What's wrong with your face?

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:27.150
Be quiet, this is the latest fashion!

00:15:27.150 --> 00:15:29.500
We played a bit of tennis yesterday.

00:15:29.500 --> 00:15:30.530
Lala!

00:15:30.530 --> 00:15:32.910
We're going to the hot springs for a bit.

00:15:34.710 --> 00:15:35.870
Tennis, eh?

00:15:44.460 --> 00:15:46.040
What? Do you want something?

00:15:46.040 --> 00:15:49.010
There may be a Bad Item nearby.

00:15:49.010 --> 00:15:52.910
You leave me home all alone, letting me miss out on all the beautiful girls playing tennis!

00:15:52.910 --> 00:15:54.010
Now what are you talking about?

00:15:54.010 --> 00:15:56.970
Oyajiide, let's go find the Bad Item together.

00:15:56.970 --> 00:15:58.390
Bad Item?

00:15:58.390 --> 00:15:59.930
I don't understand a word you're saying.

00:15:59.930 --> 00:16:01.380
Really? Well then...

00:16:01.380 --> 00:16:02.900
We'll go find it ourselves.

00:16:02.900 --> 00:16:04.220
W-Wait!

00:16:04.220 --> 00:16:06.130
I must see those beautiful girls playing tennis!

00:16:07.770 --> 00:16:09.760
The white lines on the court...

00:16:09.760 --> 00:16:12.610
And the white miniskirts...

00:16:12.610 --> 00:16:14.570
You're talking about the tennis courts?

00:16:14.570 --> 00:16:18.290
Right! Take me to the tennis courts right now! Where the beautiful girls are!

00:16:18.290 --> 00:16:20.010
That trick again?

00:16:20.010 --> 00:16:21.090
We can't help it.

00:16:21.090 --> 00:16:22.410
Let's go check anyway.

00:16:22.410 --> 00:16:24.460
Yeah, there's no other way.

00:16:25.120 --> 00:16:26.810
Where's Kashiwagi-kun?

00:16:26.810 --> 00:16:27.420
Over there!

00:16:30.630 --> 00:16:32.460
He's so cool.

00:16:32.460 --> 00:16:35.170
Whatever, we can use this chance to check out his things.

00:16:41.530 --> 00:16:42.890
Oh! Look at those legs!

00:16:46.100 --> 00:16:47.270
That old man's so simple.

00:16:47.270 --> 00:16:48.390
Be serious!

00:16:48.390 --> 00:16:49.580
Yeah, yeah.

00:16:49.580 --> 00:16:50.820
How about this?

00:16:53.870 --> 00:16:55.030
Nothing in there.

00:16:55.030 --> 00:16:57.130
Really? Take a good look.

00:16:57.130 --> 00:17:00.990
Oh yeah, doesn't Kashiwagi-kun have a locker inside the clubhouse?

00:17:00.990 --> 00:17:02.080
You're right.

00:17:02.080 --> 00:17:03.710
Maybe it's in there.

00:17:03.710 --> 00:17:05.860
Then let's go take a look.

00:17:05.860 --> 00:17:08.260
I think you're just fooling around with us every time this happens.

00:17:08.260 --> 00:17:09.670
Now that's not true.

00:17:11.800 --> 00:17:13.380
So? Do ya see anything?

00:17:14.130 --> 00:17:17.700
If this were the girl's locker room, I could easily find it.

00:17:17.700 --> 00:17:18.660
Stop fooling around!

00:17:18.660 --> 00:17:20.350
We'll be discovered if we don't hurry.

00:17:21.680 --> 00:17:24.310
Nope. I think it's over at the girl's side.

00:17:24.310 --> 00:17:26.580
Give me a break!

00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:29.630
Ain't this Kashiwagi-kun's locker?

00:17:29.630 --> 00:17:31.170
I wonder if it's locked.

00:17:31.170 --> 00:17:31.780
Huh?

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:34.920
That's the lucky charm.

00:17:35.690 --> 00:17:37.060
This is what we were talking about.

00:17:37.060 --> 00:17:37.910
How's this, Oyajiide?

00:17:41.240 --> 00:17:44.600
That's-it-that's-it-that's-it-that's-it THAT'S IT!

00:17:44.600 --> 00:17:45.370
Yeah!

00:17:45.370 --> 00:17:47.830
It's a Bad Item!

00:17:47.830 --> 00:17:49.820
Thank you, old man.

00:17:49.820 --> 00:17:51.800
I'm not an old man, I'm Oyajii-!

00:17:51.800 --> 00:17:53.490
Aren't they the same thing?
I'm not an old man, I'm Oyajii-!

00:17:55.170 --> 00:17:58.440
Pirika Pirilala Carefreely!

00:18:01.470 --> 00:18:04.910
Paipai Ponpoi Flexibly!

00:18:07.480 --> 00:18:10.520
Pameruku Laruku Proudly!

00:18:19.820 --> 00:18:21.850
Magical Stage!

00:18:28.160 --> 00:18:30.250
Come out, Bad Card!

00:18:43.210 --> 00:18:44.320
Here, Doremi-chan.

00:18:44.320 --> 00:18:44.920
Yeah.

00:18:48.940 --> 00:18:52.190
We finally succeeded this time.

00:18:52.190 --> 00:18:54.270
Now that lucky charm is normal again.

00:18:54.270 --> 00:18:58.780
Yep, now Kashiwagi-kun will finally confess to me.

00:18:58.780 --> 00:19:01.200
Can't ya think of anything else?

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:03.820
Kashiwagi-kun's so slow...

00:19:05.190 --> 00:19:06.180
Ai-chan?

00:19:07.370 --> 00:19:07.920
He's here.

00:19:08.800 --> 00:19:10.820
We'll be waiting for you outside.

00:19:10.820 --> 00:19:12.290
Do yer best, Doremi-chan.

00:19:15.130 --> 00:19:15.680
Hey.

00:19:15.680 --> 00:19:16.510
Kashiwagi-kun.

00:19:22.300 --> 00:19:23.350
Kashiwagi-kun?

00:19:23.730 --> 00:19:25.020
What is it, Doremi-chan?

00:19:25.020 --> 00:19:27.810
U-Um, do you have anything you need to say to me?

00:19:30.220 --> 00:19:32.270
That reaction... I knew it.

00:19:32.270 --> 00:19:35.730
Actually, I do have something to ask you.

00:19:35.730 --> 00:19:37.440
How did you know?

00:19:37.440 --> 00:19:41.150
I-I think this must be the goddess of love blessing you.

00:19:41.150 --> 00:19:42.110
Really?

00:19:42.110 --> 00:19:45.030
Your future is very bright, Kashiwagi-kun.

00:19:45.030 --> 00:19:47.520
Doremi-chan! Here I go!

00:19:47.520 --> 00:19:49.320
Jeez, I missed.

00:19:49.890 --> 00:19:51.680
Doremi, you're so clumsy.

00:19:51.680 --> 00:19:53.860
Ahh, you're so mean...

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:57.560
So what did you want to ask me?

00:19:57.560 --> 00:19:59.750
Um, is there anyone you like?

00:19:59.750 --> 00:20:01.490
No, there's no such person.

00:20:01.490 --> 00:20:02.520
I see.

00:20:02.520 --> 00:20:04.470
Then can I tell you my confession?

00:20:04.470 --> 00:20:06.900
That's fine, of course.

00:20:06.900 --> 00:20:08.530
I've been waiting for so long.

00:20:08.530 --> 00:20:11.050
Is that so? You've been waiting...

00:20:11.050 --> 00:20:12.940
Is this really okay?

00:20:12.940 --> 00:20:14.440
O-O-Of course.

00:20:14.440 --> 00:20:17.460
So, Kashiwagi-kun, what kind of girls do you like?

00:20:17.460 --> 00:20:19.570
What kind of things interest you?

00:20:20.540 --> 00:20:24.870
I'm very interested in athletic girls.

00:20:24.870 --> 00:20:27.580
Athletic?

00:20:27.580 --> 00:20:30.310
Ai-chan is very athletic, right?

00:20:37.020 --> 00:20:37.420
Oh my...

00:20:37.420 --> 00:20:38.880
What!? You rejected him!?

00:20:38.880 --> 00:20:40.210
Yes, I did.

00:20:40.210 --> 00:20:42.380
Huh? Huh? Are you talking about Kashiwagi-kun?

00:20:42.380 --> 00:20:44.610
Why? It's such a waste...

00:20:44.610 --> 00:20:45.790
Why, you ask?

00:20:45.790 --> 00:20:49.780
He ain't my type 'cause he can't understand my jokes!

00:20:49.780 --> 00:20:51.770
He's not your type...?

00:20:51.770 --> 00:20:56.110
Then Doremi-chan and Kashiwagi-kun both got dumped.

00:20:56.770 --> 00:20:59.730
Ah, with Tamaki-san, that makes three.

00:21:00.030 --> 00:21:01.740
What did you say?

00:21:01.740 --> 00:21:04.610
Tamaki, she's completely right.

00:21:04.610 --> 00:21:06.660
Well, don't be too sad yourself.

00:21:08.010 --> 00:21:11.620
Well, that was a love that could never be.

00:21:11.620 --> 00:21:15.650
You normal girls would never understand.

00:21:15.650 --> 00:21:19.430
It's a sorrow that only an upper-class person can experience.

00:21:19.430 --> 00:21:21.630
Tamaki Reika!

00:21:23.280 --> 00:21:25.800
Doremi-chan, don't mind it so much.

00:21:25.800 --> 00:21:28.080
You'll definitely meet better guys.

00:21:28.080 --> 00:21:29.100
She's right.

00:21:29.100 --> 00:21:32.040
Heh! This is definitely your punishment.

00:21:32.040 --> 00:21:32.900
What do you mean?

00:21:32.900 --> 00:21:36.060
Because you had impure thoughts while searching for the Bad Item.

00:21:36.060 --> 00:21:37.050
What!?

00:21:37.050 --> 00:21:40.440
Didn't you go and play tennis, bathe in the hot springs, and fool around all day!?

00:21:40.440 --> 00:21:43.790
Having fun and having impure thoughts have nothing to do with each other.

00:21:43.790 --> 00:21:49.410
Oh? How about your thoughts of trying to beat me to a pulp in tennis? Aren't those impure?

00:21:49.410 --> 00:21:55.030
In any case, if you have time to be worrying about these pointless things, go practice some more magic!

00:21:55.030 --> 00:21:59.840
Wow! I am the world's unluckiest pretty girl!

00:22:02.340 --> 00:22:03.520
Today is the summer festival!

00:22:03.520 --> 00:22:05.680
The Maho-dou has also put up a stand!

00:22:05.680 --> 00:22:08.730
But there is a pickpocket around that is causing a huge ruckus at the festival.

00:22:08.730 --> 00:22:11.240
Ahhh! My Apprentice Tap got stolen!

00:22:11.240 --> 00:22:13.860
There's a dog and a horse running around at the festival!

00:22:13.860 --> 00:22:17.120
We see Yuki-sensei's boyfriend! And Seki-sensei is here too!

00:22:17.120 --> 00:22:18.700
And Doremi-chan gets arrested by the police!

00:22:18.700 --> 00:22:20.130
Why did I get arrested!

00:22:20.130 --> 00:22:21.650
You were mistaken for the pickpocket!

00:22:21.650 --> 00:22:23.100
What do we do, Doremi-chan?

00:22:23.100 --> 00:22:24.320
Ojamajo Doremi!

00:22:24.320 --> 00:22:26.570
The Tap that Disappeared at the Festival!

00:22:26.580 --> 00:22:29.170
Happy! Lucky! For all of you!
